WEBVTT

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.940
Go, Shoot!

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:37.820
Takao's desire to beat the Psykicks no
matter what led him to modify Dragoon.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:41.240
He completely lost
sight of his own style.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.750
As such, Ozma challenged Takao to a battle.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.040
Go, Shoot!

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:53.840
Through his battle with Ozma,
he regained his own style.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.260
And now, the time for our
match has finally come!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.530
The day of your battle
has finally arrived.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:25.870
I will be accompanying you kids this time,
to make sure they won't pull any dirty tricks.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.830
So please battle to
your heart's content!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.750
Thanks for coming,
Chairman Daitenji.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.710
Well then, shall we?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.680
Just you wait, Psykicks!
Today we're gonna settle the score!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:43.300
Takao, you're wide open!

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.970
You let your guard down, Takao.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:50.140
Do you think you can win
an important match like that?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.940
The battle has
already begun, boy!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.280
Chairman...!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.030
Are you okay?
I am so sorry...

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.780
You see, I was aiming for Takao...

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:07.620
Hey! Takao!
Why did you dodge?!

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:19.340
Best of luck, boys!
Don't lose to Team Psykick!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.230
And off they go.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.150
We should get moving, too.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.440
We know how they work.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.650
We don't know what kinds of
cheap tricks they have in store.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:42.280
We can't let the four Sacred
Beasts fall into Psykick's hands!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.530
Let's go.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.000
The final checks
have been completed.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.000
Well done.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.130
How are Kane and
the others faring?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:01.260
They are waiting for you in
the control room, Mr. Gideon.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.680
I see. I'll head there soon.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.590
Yes.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.980
Doctor Zagart.
We're all ready to go.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:20.280
The time has finally come for us
to obtain the four Sacred Beasts!

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.240
Failure is not an option.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:30.240
Be at ease. According to the Doctor's research,
our digital Sacred Beasts are several,

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:35.000
no, several tens of times more powerful.
Those BBA kids don't stand a chance.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.340
Mhm. Don't let your guard
down for even a second.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.340
Yes, sir.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.940
The digital Sacred Beasts do in
fact have unfathomable power.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.360
Far more so than our four.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.910
But I believe in them.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.830
Takao and the team can do it!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.120
I just know it!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.210
Today's the day...

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:19.340
For Takao to put
an end to all this...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:25.420
Come to think of it, I used to not understand
the first thing about Beyblading...

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.720
But after hanging around
Takao and Kyoujyu,

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:33.390
I've been drawn in by
Beyblade's fun and appeal...

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.640
And now it's come to this.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:39.980
I don't want them to lose to
Team Psykick after coming all this way.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.940
I want Takao and the team
to win, no matter what!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.610
Who cares about some
dumb digital Sacred Beasts?

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.240
Do your best, guys!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.790
I'll never lose to Team Psykick.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:58.960
Not after all that
training we did.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.180
Go, Shoot!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.810
Go!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.060
I refuse to lose!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.990
--Go, Shoot!

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.170
You're just being
used by Psykick!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.050
Why can't you see that?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.890
I... I want to become strong!
Just like you!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.190
Are you okay?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.730
Yuya!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.150
Kai...

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:10.660
Yuya. I will avenge you.
I swear it.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.250
I-it's you!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.500
Rei...

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:32.130
What's the point of battling when you
overwhelm the opponent with pure power

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.550
under the manipulation
of a Sacred Beast?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:37.890
I can't fight a battle like that.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.230
This girl is thinking
the same thing I am...

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.960
Rei, I would love to
battle you someday.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:51.990
As friends, not foes.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.920
I don't care what kinds of tricks they'll use.
I will battle my own way!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.960
And I'll win!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.730
Kane!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.270
Kane!!

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.690
Kinomiya!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:31.490
You're just being tricked!
Don't listen to them!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.450
Kane!!

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.200
Kane...

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.620
I never thought I'd be
battling you like this.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:44.460
But I can't lose.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:49.210
I will beat the digital Sacred Beasts
with my own two hands!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.590
There it is, kids!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.970
Awright!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:02.560
Is that the arena?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.570
We've finally arrived!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.690
We've done all we can.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.530
Just hit 'em head on with
what you've trained with!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:20.280
We can win if we
battle our own way!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.870
We'll never lose!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.460
Let's go, guys!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:26.960
--Yeah!!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.880
No one's here.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:40.180
Hey hey hey! You call us all the way out here
and we don't even get a warm welcome?!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:46.730
Welcome, BBA, to Team
Psykick's Battle Tower.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.900
Who are you?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.730
Oh yes, I haven't introduced myself.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:57.530
My name is Gideon.
Chief executive of Psykick.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:02.540
So everything up to now
was under your orders, then?

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.660
So the boss has finally showed up, huh?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.170
We're here to settle the
score so say your prayers!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.750
Always so reliably
forward, you are.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.840
Allow me to explain how
our Battle Tower works.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:21.430
There's one stadium per floor,
from floors two to five.

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:27.310
Each floor has a Blader waiting who's
just fit for battle each one of you.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:31.560
In short, there are
four battles in total.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.480
The rules are simple.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.320
A no holds barred
one-on-one battle.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:41.570
The battle ends when one Sacred Beast is
rendered unable to battle. A deathmatch, if you will.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.660
Sounds like fun! We accept!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.910
Wait just one moment!

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.790
This is supposed to
be an official battle!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.840
We cannot accept these rules!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:57.590
What's your point, old man?
You think they're going buy that?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:01.300
We will never lose,
no matter what you pull!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:04.560
We will defeat all of your
digital Sacred Beasts!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.890
B-but you see...

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:10.190
Chairman Daitenji.
Let them do it.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.360
They've all been
training for this day!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.480
Yeah. To battle these
digital Sacred Beasts!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.900
Please, Chairman Daitenji!

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.490
I understand.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:27.660
If that's what you're all
prepared to do, I can't say no...

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.040
Then that's that.

00:11:29.410 --> 00:11:32.290
I'm looking forward to your battles.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.090
If you can make
it to the stadium.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.500
What?!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.470
Hey! What's that supposed to mean?!

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:03.910
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:08.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:14.000
If we want to battle the digital Sacred
Beasts, we need to beat these first.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.840
These guys sure are full of it.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.300
This'll be a good warm up!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.350
Get them!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.730
Go, Shoot!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:38.770
Shoot!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.440
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.240
Dranzer!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.330
Driger!

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:56.130
Now!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.670
Too easy!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.510
No!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.140
Fortress Defense!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.100
Thank you, Max!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.690
Pay attention.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.440
This is how they battle.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.040
They did it!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.800
Piece of cake!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.300
Let's go, guys!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.270
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:59.940
They may have been trying
to damage your Beyblades!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.110
What?!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.190
Reporting damage points.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.740
Dragoon, 23.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.280
Dranzer, 12.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:07.820
Driger, 36.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.410
Draciel, 45.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.700
Psykick's victory is guaranteed!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.870
Pulling out low tricks again...

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.420
Gideon, right? Isn't this
way too underhanded?

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:24.050
Why don't you fight us fairly
with your digital Sacred Beasts?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.380
Say something, darn it!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.420
Gosh!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.260
Hiromi!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.780
Ozma!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.570
It's them! When did they...

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.450
What are you all doing here?

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:00.670
We're obviously
worried about you, duh!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:05.420
We just can't let these scientists get
their hands on your Sacred Beasts.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.380
Consider us on your
side this time.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:11.340
Leave this to us. Get moving!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.640
Guys...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.680
Let's go, Kinomiya!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.470
Yeah!

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.850
Where do you
think you're aiming?

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.860
We'll take you on now!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.440
Wait for me!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.450
This sort of dangerous
activity is not allowed!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:36.950
Beyblading must follow
the official rules!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.330
Let's wrap this up fast.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.580
Crush 'em into pieces!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.710
Voltic Ape!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:44.330
Sharcrash!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.630
Vanishing Moot!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.010
This is it!

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.510
What's up with this room?

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.770
I just know there's some
kind of trap hidden in here!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.600
C'mon! We showed up
just like you wanted!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.770
Send out our opponent!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.570
Allow me to introduce them.

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.900
Max's opponent in the first battle.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.490
Jim!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.200
Look at his face!

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:21.960
What intensity...!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.500
That's Jim?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.960
Really, that Jim?
The same one we met at the river?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:30.170
Max, don't lose to him.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.180
So they won't let us interfere...

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.270
Max! You can do it!

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.480
We've got your back!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:51.610
I've been waiting for this, Max!
I'm going to wipe the floor with your Draciel!

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.950
If you think you can,
then be my guest!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.870
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.660
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.760
What's the matter?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.880
Darn it! I won't lose!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.050
Go, Draciel!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.510
Keep it up, Max!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.930
That's the way!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.270
That's cute. Cyber Draciel!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.570
You're pretty good.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.030
But you don't stand a chance!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.860
Enough fooling around.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.450
Cyber Draciel!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.330
Finally showed up!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.330
Genbu!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.970
Go!!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.050
Genbu got blown back!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.640
You call that an attack?

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:08.730
What amazing power.
It's totally different from last time!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.490
Do you see? This is the power
of a digital Sacred Beast!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.160
I'm gonna wrap
this up in one blow!

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.130
Genbu's Sacred Beast
index is decreasing rapidly.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.010
190. 49. 31.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.430
Yes! Finish him!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.190
Sacred Beast index. Zero!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:57.690
Now's your chance!
Pummel Draciel!

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.660
Finish him off!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.330
Max!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.950
You can do it!!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:09.210
That's it, Max! Go for it!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:12.830
Max!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.670
You guys...

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.550
What?!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.550
Why you tricky little...

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.180
But you won't last long like that!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.260
Go, Cyber Draciel!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.640
--Max!
--Max!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.900
--You got this!
--Max!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:43.200
How is this possible?
His Sacred Beast index is down to zero!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:47.080
So how can he
withstand those attacks?

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.580
Is this the power of
the four Sacred Beasts?

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.290
This is what Mr. Zagart was after...

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:54.750
The Sacred Beast index
is increasing rapidly!

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:56.670
What did you...?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.720
I can't lose...
Everyone's counting on me!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:03.090
I can't lose...

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:05.760
I can't lose!!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.930
Genbu!!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.450
My...!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.370
He did it!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.590
Way to go, Max!

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:37.880
He did it!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.250
He beat a digital Sacred Beast!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.710
I won...

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.420
I won!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:47.970
What's that?

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.020
The digital Sacred
Beast is being repaired!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.150
That's impossible!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.360
Is that what that machine is?

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.360
A repair machine for
the digital Sacred Beast?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.530
This match is just getting started!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.960
There's no end to this!

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.630
What's he supposed to do?

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:04.860
Each floor of Team Psykick's battlefield
has Sacred Beast repair systems in place!

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:07.650
So no matter how many times they
go down, they get right back up!

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:11.030
"Could I regain my youth
if I used that system?"

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.990
Chairman! What are you saying?!

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:16.700
But I think it's worth trying out!

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:18.580
Will Chairman regain his youth?

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:20.560
You won't want to miss it!
